      "value": "@{5dc5b9b25689666d718db510|full_name}: I was a trusted user with a 1000 hours of active play, over 300 friends, and 5 public worlds. I went through a friend purge and unfriended everyone. I went down to known user. Then after 2 weeks of slowly gaining friends, at 30 friends I went back to trusted user. I don't send out friend requests, I let people friend request me.",
