      "value": "@{5b9c34c626943a0848c2a014|full_name}: It would be nice to change the way the rank algorithim works so that friends who haven't been online in a LONG time won't act as a penalty to the trust rank if you defriend them. I literally became a trusted user after only 430 hours, four hundred friends, four avatars, and world that shows every way possible to optimize VRChat for framerate. Epic.",
